Subject: raise the bytecode version for the whole patch series

The opcode and serialized-function changes in this series are not compatible with upstream bytecode. Raise the format version once, at the end of the series, so patched runtimes reject bytecode produced by an incompatible engine instead of failing later during loading. This patch also rebuilds the embedded built-ins with the final opcode table and metadata format.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  This is the bump.


